      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Horus había ganado el trono de Egipto. Tras ochenta años de juicio, los dioses lo coronaron rey.",
          "en": "Horus had won the throne of Egypt. After eighty years of judgment, the gods crowned him king."
        },
        {
          "es": "Isis lloró de alegría, y Osiris, el rey asesinado, por fin estaba vengado.",
          "en": "Isis wept with joy, and Osiris, the murdered king, was finally avenged."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero había un rey que no podía descansar ni un solo día: Ra, el dios del sol.",
          "en": "But there was one king who could never rest, not for a single day: Ra, the sun god."
        },
        {
          "es": "Cada mañana cruzaba el cielo en su barca, y cada tarde se hundía en el oeste.",
          "en": "Every morning he crossed the sky in his boat, and every evening he sank into the west."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y lo que le pasaba después, en la oscuridad, era el mayor secreto de Egipto.",
          "en": "And what happened to him afterward, in the dark, was the greatest secret in Egypt."
        }
      ],
